body:
Following #295. Here a first draft of api proposal
# API

```
search.addWidget(
  instantsearch.widgets.numericRefinementList({
    container: '#refinement-date-selector',
    attributeName: 'age'
    options: [
      {name: 'All'},
      {end: 4, name: 'less than 4'},
      {start: 4, end: 4, name: '4'},
      {start: 5, end: 10, name: 'between 5 and 9'},
      {start: 11, name: 'more than 10'},
    ]
    // cssClasses: {root, header, body, footer, list, item, active, label, checkbox, count}
    // templates: {header, item, footer}
    // label: "Age"
    // hideContainerWhenNoRefinements: true
    // options.operator='or'
  })
);
```

The rendering would be the same as refinement list the thing that will change is how we handle the refiements

I did an example with age but this widget would be able to be use for date and handle things like:

